    "description": {
      "value": "<p>, The most adept priests leave their houses of worship to serve on the battlefield as shepherds to flock. There, they use their holy powers to bless allies and mend wounds. And while most stay behind the frontlines to aid their comrades, these holy champions are also capable of smiting foes and carrying out sacred justice.</p><h2>Holy Calling Spell</h2><table><tbody><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Priest Level</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Spells</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">1st</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.8dzaICjGy6mTUaUr]{Bless}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.uUWb1wZgtMou0TVP]{Cure Wounds}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">3rd</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.F0GsG0SJzsIOacwV]{Lesser Restoration}, @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.spells.Item.yGvnT90SU5kobLvJ]{Shining Force}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">5th</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.ZU9d6woBdUP8pIPt]{Beacon of Hope}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.LmRHHMtplpxr9fX6]{Revivify}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">7th</p></td><td><p>Aura of Life, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.VtCXMdyM6mAdIJZb]{Death Ward}</p></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"51\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">9th</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.Pyzmm8R7rVsNAPsd]{Mass Cure Wounds}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.AGFMPAmuzwWO6Dfz]{Raise Dead}</p></td></tr></tbody></table>",
